LingTu MLS Core
===============

This crate is a native LingTu adaptation of the multi-level surface, sparse
node, and corridor graph ideas in Dimensional Inc.'s DimOS MLS planner.

Reference source:
https://github.com/dimensionalOS/dimos/tree/main/dimos/navigation/global_planner/mls_planner/rust/src

The reference project and its MLS source files are Apache License 2.0.
Copyright 2025 Dimensional Inc.

This crate is an independent, dependency-free Rust implementation for LingTu.
It does not include the DimOS module runtime, generated messages, or runtime
bindings. LingTu-specific changes and code are covered by the repository
license and the applicable Apache-2.0 terms for the referenced ideas.
